                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d643b8c-bdc9-3b97-8a96-ad1c0ae6f588",
                        "entry_id": "a9235811-7572-35f7-91a0-f3f4b3c35f0b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Aggravating; annoying, irritating, obnoxious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb3a5f60-5ffb-484a-9229-c9c3b48dc8be",
                                "sense_id": "4d643b8c-bdc9-3b97-8a96-ad1c0ae6f588",
                                "text": "But whatever you think of Bieber, the adverts are questionable for reasons other than the singer's reputation for being an aggy teenager with an unfortunate tendency to offend and irritate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfcc2ce7-70a5-466c-9d65-4e8e189dfdae",
                                "sense_id": "4d643b8c-bdc9-3b97-8a96-ad1c0ae6f588",
                                "text": "These encapsulate the trio at their modern finest, vocalist Maxim stalking mercilessly while Keith Flint plays the aggy child antagonizing everyone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c9f699b-9776-4c39-80a2-e12fab48ee8c",
                                "sense_id": "4d643b8c-bdc9-3b97-8a96-ad1c0ae6f588",
                                "text": "“Girl asap I need to get away from Tekey. Before I spit on him he's so aggy lil jealous ass.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d782e168-111e-4fec-9767-6dc3d1364f8d",
                                "sense_id": "4d643b8c-bdc9-3b97-8a96-ad1c0ae6f588",
                                "text": "For quotations using this term, see Citations:aggy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                        "entry_id": "a9235811-7572-35f7-91a0-f3f4b3c35f0b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Aggravated; aggressive, angry."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f60f7559-c889-45f7-8d13-a4001a33b3b2",
                                "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                                "text": "I got aggie like a motherfucker."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7728fe42-67f2-4a8e-800e-9797624f5c98",
                                "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                                "text": "So he responded with two oversized hits: \"Cock Back,\" which he calls \"the aggiest gun tune ever,\" and \"So Sure,\" a remarkably relaxed and tender tune […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f570ef4-1cd6-4708-9564-0c39fc3d2e28",
                                "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                                "text": "I hated curriculum, I hated my tutors, I hated the people. I came to my final year and I realized like, wait... why am I getting so aggy about all this?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ea9b677-a5c3-4efd-822e-b21522f55d1a",
                                "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                                "text": "Ring, ring, rin-\n\"What!\"\n\"Nice to hear from you too, Spect. Why are you so aggy?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a188f369-dfb6-44d6-8256-a901a55e9f7f",
                                "sense_id": "30b467dd-173e-3fa6-9735-ca56bd3b920f",
                                "text": "For quotations using this term, see Citations:aggy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
